  icon: {fileID: 0}
  itemDescription: "Gaming and Immersive Technology Institute  Synergy Sphere  This
    institute is dedicated to the gaming industry and immersive technologies like
    augmented reality (AR) and virtual reality (VR). Its mission includes developing
    AR/VR applications, nurturing the video game development ecosystem, and innovating
    in gamification for education and training. Key focus areas: game engine development
    and localization, creating AR/VR experiences relevant to culture and education,
    and supporting startups in the gaming sector (through incubators or technical
    expertise). The institute enhances Saudi Arabia\u2019s digital content creation
    capabilities, supporting initiatives like the Saudi Esports and digital entertainment
    push. Ultimately, it aims to position the Kingdom as a producer of world-class
    games and immersive experiences, not just a consumer, and to leverage AR/VR for
    economic and societal benefits"
